{{ENExclusive}}
'''Mollyanna Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Tower of Saviors Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 13.3 Update|Version 13.3]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 742
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Mollyanna Cat
|name2 = Mesmerizing Tune - Mollyanna
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Mesmerizing Tune - Mollyanna''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Mollyanna Cat is a usable Collaboration Cat, surprisingly enough. Her main competition is [[Gardener Cat (Rare Cat)|Weedwacker Cat]], who has a higher, but very inconsistent, freeze uptime. Despite this, she has a faster recharge and much higher range, allowing her to be stacked much easier than Weedwacker Cat. Should she be stacked with good timing, she could almost perma-stun zombies that have either already burrowed or cannot burrow. Her higher range even allows her to work against [[Lord Gravey]], though she is much worse against [[Miss Haka]] and [[Big Sal]] in exchange.

Note that she has a higher speed in her Evolved Form. Because she can't deal with [[Burrow|burrowing]] Zombies thanks to her long foreswing, her Evolved Form is typically preferred.

{{Job|Classification = Crowd-Controller}}

